    "blokken": [
      "About me",
      "Hi, I'm Dave Willemstein. Independent AI consultant for boards and leaders who want to move forward.",
      "I help organizations make AI decisions that create value, limit risk, and actually fit their strategy. No sales pitch. No tool preferences. Just clear advice, sharp choices, and guidance from people to process.",
      "Book a call → Get in touch → 30 min., no pitch deck",
      "trust, experience, impact ↓",
      "Independent No vendor bias Senior only Since 2006",
      "AI in Europe",
      "European brands already running AI in production.",
      "Not my clients. Examples of what happens once AI moves past the pilot stage.",
