      "Philips",
      "Netherlands",
      "AI in medical imaging",
      "Proces & productivity",
      "Professional services firm",
      "Internal AI assistant for knowledge workers",
      "My story",
      "From strategy to execution. With impact.",
      "After twenty years in strategy, digital and innovation, on both the client and vendor side, I kept seeing the same pattern: good intentions, vague choices. Tools before strategy. Hype before value. And advisors who profited from the very solution they recommended.",
      "I started freelanceaiconsultant.com to change that. I work independently, on my own, always in your interest. One senior advisor. No juniors on your project. No noise.",
      "That also means I can't do everything. Large implementation programs, teams of ten developers, global rollouts: that's not what I'm the right partner for, and I'll say so.",
      "Experience at a glance",
      "✓",
      "Since 2006 Strategy, digital and innovation, on both the client and vendor side",
      "✓",
      "100+ engagements From AI strategy and vendor selection to implementation guidance",
      "✓",
      "Executive sparring partner For CIOs, CFOs, CEOs and supervisory boards",
      "✓",
      "Published & speaker On AI, leadership and change management",
      "What I believe",
      "✓",
      "Independent",
      "Your interest, always. No commissions, no partner deals.",
      "✓",
      "Transparent",
      "Clear about both opportunities and risks, even when it is uncomfortable.",
      "✓",
      "Pragmatic",
      "From strategy to measurable value within one quarter.",
      "✓",
      "People-first",
      "Technology only works once people actually want to work with it.",
      "Background",
      "Where this experience comes from.",
      "Now",
      "Independent AI advisor",
      "Strategy, vendor selection, governance and fractional AI leadership for organizations in the Netherlands, Belgium and Germany.",
      "Before that",
      "Leadership roles in digital & data",
      "Responsible for data-driven programs in larger organizations. This is where I learned how many good plans fail on ownership and management, not on technology.",
      "Before that",
      "Consulting and vendor side",
      "Sat on the other side of the table. That is exactly why I now accept no commissions or partner deals: I know how those steer the advice.",
      "How I work in practice",
      "I'll tell you when I think you don't need me.",
      "I write everything myself. Whatever you get from me, I made it and can defend it.",
      "I work on a maximum of three engagements at a time, so attention never becomes scarce.",
      "I never take on two direct competitors at the same time.",
      "After three months I come back to check the promised result is actually there.",
      "Outside of work",
      "I read a lot about decision-making and risk, fields AI has surprisingly little to learn from. Beyond that: running, cooking, and the occasional DIY project gone wrong.",
      "I also speak: about AI decision-making, governance, and why most pilots stall. I'd rather have a sharp conversation with twenty people than give a keynote to five hundred.",
      "Ask about availability →",
      "Contact",
      "Let's get acquainted.",
      "Available for new engagements from Q4",
      "dave@freelanceaiconsultant.com LinkedIn ↗ Go to the contact form →",
      "Ready for impact?",
      "Book a no-obligation call.",
      "30 minutes. Online. No pitch deck. Just value.",
      "30 min., no pitch deckBook a call →"
